From: Heinrich Schuchardt <heinrich.schuchardt@canonical.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Jan 2025 13:37:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 202/214] riscv: fml13v01_defconfig: add Atheros 802.11ac
 wireless cards support

Signed-off-by: Heinrich Schuchardt <heinrich.schuchardt@canonical.com>
---
 arch/riscv/configs/fml13v01_defconfig | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/riscv/configs/fml13v01_defconfig b/arch/riscv/configs/fml13v01_defconfig
index 34ed4ab49ffd..0cbf673d3fbd 100644
--- a/arch/riscv/configs/fml13v01_defconfig
+++ b/arch/riscv/configs/fml13v01_defconfig
@@ -173,6 +173,12 @@ CONFIG_MICROCHIP_PHY=y
 CONFIG_MOTORCOMM_PHY=y
 CONFIG_IPMS_CAN=y
 CONFIG_USB_RTL8152=y
+CONFIG_ATH10K=m
+CONFIG_ATH10K_PCI=m
+CONFIG_ATH10K_SDIO=m
+CONFIG_ATH10K_USB=m
+CONFIG_ATH10K_DEBUGFS=y
+CONFIG_ATH10K_SPECTRAL=y
 CONFIG_IPW2100=y
 CONFIG_IWLWIFI=y
 CONFIG_IWLDVM=y
